# TypeScript 与 Node.js — 类型安全的后端开发

## Express 类型标注

Express 是最流行的 Node.js 框架，配合 TypeScript 可以让路由、中间件都有类型保护：
```typescript
import express, { Request, Response, NextFunction } from "express";

const app = express();

app.get("/users/:id", (req: Request, res: Response) => {
    const id = req.params.id;
    res.json({ id, name: "User" + id });
});
```

## 自定义请求类型

扩展 Express 的 Request 类型来添加自定义属性：
```typescript
interface AuthRequest extends Request {
    userId?: string;
}

app.get("/profile", (req: AuthRequest, res: Response) => {
    res.json({ userId: req.userId });
});
```

## 环境变量类型安全

```typescript
interface EnvConfig {
    PORT: number;
    DB_URL: string;
    NODE_ENV: "development" | "production";
}

function getEnv(): EnvConfig {
    return {
        PORT: Number(process.env.PORT) || 3000,
        DB_URL: process.env.DB_URL || "localhost",
        NODE_ENV: (process.env.NODE_ENV as "development" | "production") || "development"
    };
}
```

## 中间件类型

```typescript
function logger(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): void {
    console.log(`${req.method} ${req.url}`);
    next();
}
```

## 练习
编写函数 `parseEnvConfig(env: Record<string, string | undefined>)`，从环境变量对象中解析配置，返回 `{ port: number, host: string }`，port 默认 3000，host 默认 "localhost"。

starter_code:
interface EnvConfig {
    port: number;
    host: string;
}

function parseEnvConfig(env: Record<string, string | undefined>): EnvConfig {
    // 从环境变量解析配置
    return { port: 0, host: "" };
}

solution_code:
interface EnvConfig {
    port: number;
    host: string;
}

function parseEnvConfig(env: Record<string, string | undefined>): EnvConfig {
    return {
        port: env.PORT ? Number(env.PORT) : 3000,
        host: env.HOST || "localhost"
    };
}

